OL,3,ABT agrees rescue deal to buy broadband
OL,4,Aoperator TalkTalk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's biggest broadband provider,
OL,7,FBT, has agreed to rescue rival operator
OL,8,FTalkTalk in a takeover.
OL,10,FThe deal, which will need to be
OL,11,Fapproved by the UK's competition
OL,12,Fregulator, would mark end of months of
OL,13,Fspeculation over the future for
OL,14,FTalkTalk, which has been on the brink
OL,15,Fof administration because of its debts.
OL,17,FTalkTalk has 1.5 million retail
OL,18,Fcustomers and one million wholesale
OL,19,Fcustomers across the UK.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
